Data source attribution
=======================

This package contains LEI data. Its archive bundles two Parquet files, a cut
of the GLEIF Golden Copy:

  data/relationship_records.parquet   every Level 2 relationship record
  data/lei_records.parquet            every Level 1 legal entity that is the
                                      start or end node of one of those records

They hold thirteen columns of the golden copy, unmodified apart from the column
selection, the row selection above, and the row order. The data/ folder is not
committed to this repository; tools/export-parquet.py in SemviaIO/gleif is the
exact recipe that writes it.

The data is the GLEIF Golden Copy — Level 1 (who is who) and Level 2 (who owns
whom) — published by the Global Legal Entity Identifier Foundation (GLEIF).

  Source:         GLEIF Golden Copy and Delta Files
                  https://www.gleif.org/en/lei-data/gleif-golden-copy/download-the-golden-copy
  Terms of use:   https://www.gleif.org/en/meta/lei-data-terms-of-use/

